'''HMS ''Amazon''''' was a {{sclass2|Tribal|destroyer|||1905}} built for the [[Royal Navy]] in the first decade of the 20th century. She survived the First World War and was sold in 1919. During the [[First World War]] she served in the [[North Sea]] and the [[English Channel]] with the [[6th Destroyer Flotilla]].

